to talk about what we mean when we say  signature combat  thanks matt now a lot has changed for us  since the first black ops game  from our development pipelines to  totally new technologies  but some things haven't changed and  after over a decade of making black ops  games we're more inspired than ever  to keep honing in on that authentic  classic black ops feel  all while taking it to new heights  now we know that to you combat is more  than just  pointing and shooting it's about how  your operator moves and weaves through  your surroundings  it's feeling the power of your weapon  how it reacts in your hands  it's the sound of bullets storming past  you the rattle and  bang of firing your weapon in cold war  we're back to plausible  authentic boots on the ground combat and  that has allowed us to not only refine  the feel of the game  but build on all the classic foundations  of black ops heads up gameplay  automated healing and grounded movement  keeping your player experience in the  front of our minds  has also inspired a fresh wave of  thinking across our creative class  and score streak system where we're  introducing features  that bring unprecedented transparency to  your planning  and cinematic wow moments to when you're  playing  now innovating systems while still  capturing that signature black ops super  smooth feel  is a notoriously tricky thing to get  just right and we put everything we have  into it for each game  this is an absolute team effort so i  brought some of my friends from the  combat team  to help tell you about our initiatives  for this game and how they've resulted  in signature combat that feels just  right  here's max porter to start us off  we've taken lessons learned from across  black ops and the entire call of duty  franchise to land on a truly  best-in-class weapon experience the gun  is almost always right in front of you  and must look great  from a gun seems down to its grime the  level of detail in black ops cold war  has never  been higher but our weapons also need to  move in a realistic manner  you'll feel it in this game whether  you're clocking from long range  or firing from the hip when we think  about a gun we think about the way it  looks the way it's going to move but a  big part of the gun's personality is the  sound that it makes it's like the bark  of the dog  we're sort of imagining all these guns  as characters  that just adds to that level of realism  and that sort of immersive quality that  is unique to call of duty  it's this multifaceted approach to how  weapons look animate and sound that  together defines the feel of cold war's  signature gun fighting experience  here's alvin with a debrief on some of  the other combat systems waiting for you  in cold war  let's talk about two of the most  significant and impactful features of  multiplayer  create a class in scorestreaks our goal  with create a class in cold war  is to empower you without making  trade-offs this year  better starts with simpler create a  class will be a slot based system  no longer governed by allocations or the  pick 10 system  you'll always boast a full class of a  primary  secondary lethal tactical  field upgrade and a set of perks field  upgrades are items placed in the world  to give your team an advantage  you can earn them solely based on time  not score  and they are the only type of game  content that works on a cooldown that  lasts  after death now wild cards are back  in this system in every class you can  pick one of four wild cards  that let you do things like load your  primary weapon with up to eight  attachments  carry up to six perks double the number  of lethals and tacticals you have  or carry three primary perks from any  mix of categories  of course a key component of create a  class  is the gunsmith  in black ops cold war there are more  optics  and attachments to unlock and configure  than ever before  every primary weapon can be customized  with 54 attachments  across eight different nodes or  attachment points with at least  six options per attach point by default  you can equip  five attachments or eight with the  gunfire wild card  for the first time gutsmith will show  you what equipping an attachment does as  a positive or negative percentage  you can now build backwards specking out  the perfect gun  for results you want to see in the field  this takes the guesswork  out of the system and helps us on our  never-ending quest  to make the most balanced call of duty  game you've ever played  there's one more thing i need to talk  about first up we've updated scorestreak  so that earned score is kept  through death this change gives all  players a chance to engage with  sportswear  one of the most visceral and fun  experiences across multiplayer's  signature comedy  if you do go on a streak and string  together multiple kills before your own  death  streak score bonuses help you learn into  those higher powered score stream teams  to prevent score streaks span each score  streak will go on a cooldown after it's  used to pace out frequency  so what score streaks are we talking  about well  your favorites are back but we've also  got a few surprises  scorestreaks in cold war can be used in  all the classic ways  to aid in taking an objective to save  your team  to break up the pace of the game with a  fun new experience  we've also tailored strategy into the  system as scorestreaks can often be  neutralized through the counter school  stream  and now i'll pass it over to sunny to  share more about our operators  and how they move in black ops cold war  elite covert powerful when you play as a  cold war operator you won't just step in  the boots of a highly trained precision  instrument  every movement will have a purpose to  increase the fidelity and feel of even  the smallest elements  modelers animators and concept artists  all work  side by side planning for every point of  contact with every gun  every stance and position every scenario  thanks to increased dynamic bone counts  we've been able to enhance the effects  of physics and gravity on what you carry  from the weight of your gear like  pouches and grenades  to the way a wallet chain or rope sways  as you sprint  your entire operator will move more  naturally than ever  here's four specific ways movement has  improved through new cutting edge  techniques in the animation and  programmatic movement  the first is sprint takeoff this is the  feature that gives your operator a  running start  you start with a little sprint and then  it slows down to normal speed  this lets you feel the momentum of like  where you're going and where you're  gonna end up  we wanted to preserve the fluidity and  fun of an operator's ability to slide  in black ops cold war when you slide you  start and end in a crouch position in a  believable way  this allows two player movement states  to function better as one  all while improving gameplay enhancing  pace footstep control also plays a big  part of the new movie system  go faster and you'll make more noise of  course we still have ninja as a perk  but ninja is no longer the only way to  keep quiet  whether or not you're crouched how loud  you get is now directly tied to how fast  you're moving  lastly we've incorporated a classic jump  with a much more natural height which  will very briefly slow you down on  landing  our goal in all of these movement  mechanics is to ensure  operators actions are not just authentic  but intuitive  when you press a button or a key you  should always feel in control of your  operator  and this system has been built to  translate your decisions into dynamic  movement more seamlessly than ever  the era of the game might be the 80s but  the characters you play will move and  shoot like the world's most highly  skilled operators  signature combat it isn't just how a gun  is shot  it's how that gun feels how it sounds  how it's designed to create a combat  experience  and combat isn't just about conflict  it's also a movement  so the fluid ways in which your  operators shift around the ao  and carry the gear you outfit them in is  just as important as the choices you  give them  choices like the overhauled creative  class system or all those attachment  possibilities in gunsmith  or the new ways you can earn and deploy  score streaks in the thick of battle  these combat initiatives work together  to deliver the most intuitive  plausible authentic boots on the ground  experience possible  and they are at the heart of black ops  cold war  now on that note i'd like to introduce  miles who's going to discuss some
 

